I actually sort of rehearsed
things to say at this point.

00:04:53.249 --> 00:04:55.030
Uh, no, I... wow.

00:04:55.030 --> 00:04:55.913
That is...

00:04:56.970 --> 00:04:59.140
[laughs]

00:04:59.140 --> 00:05:00.700
it's going to be even weirder
